# Local reference material — vendored module sources kept for reading only,
# never shipped. Tracked files under docs/ (foundry-listing.html, RELEASING.md,
# upstream-v3.5.0-snapshot/) are unaffected.
docs/midi-qol-v13/
docs/other_modules/
