# Local implementation plans created for review before code changes. Keep all
# current and future plan Markdown files here so they never ship with releases.
.plans/

# Local-only release outreach drafts (working text for upstream module-author
# comments). Kept in the repo for convenient editing but never tracked, since
# the actual posted comments and their substitutions are not artifacts.
docs/outreach-drafts.md

# Local-only PR review / test-plan working notes. Generated during remediation
# of a PR (e.g. #22); kept for convenient editing but never shipped as docs.
docs/pr-*-review.md
docs/pr-*-test-plan.md
